## 🔄 Orchestrator State Machine Diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> InitConfig: User initiates request (@gsheet-to-react-orchestrator)

    state "Step 1: Smart Config Setup" as InitConfig {
        [*] --> ExtractParams: Parse dashboard-name & store target
        ExtractParams --> TouchPlaceholders: Create .wait files in sandbox
        TouchPlaceholders --> CreateLedger: Initialize plan-follower.md
    }

    InitConfig --> Step2_PromptGen

    state "Step 2: Reverse Prompt Generation" as Step2_PromptGen {
        [*] --> CallReverseSkill: Invoke gsheet-react-dashboard-reverse
        CallReverseSkill --> SavePrompt: Write reverse-prompt-<feature-name>.md
    }

    Step2_PromptGen --> Step3_BatchCollection: Update plan-follower.md ledger

    state "Step 3: Batch Artifact Collection Gate (PAUSE)" as Step3_BatchCollection {
        [*] --> TouchPlaceholders: Create .wait placeholder files
        TouchPlaceholders --> DisplayChecklist: Display save locations to user
        DisplayChecklist --> AwaitUserConfirmation: Stop output and await turn prompt
        AwaitUserConfirmation --> UserSavesFiles: User saves specifications, CSV, and HTML DOM
        UserSavesFiles --> TriggerNextTurn: User replies "Confirm Artifacts Saved"
    }

    Step3_BatchCollection --> Step4_HTMLSplit: Triggered by "Confirm Artifacts Saved"

    state "Step 4: HTML & CSS Auto-Split" as Step4_HTMLSplit {
        [*] --> RunSplitScript: Execute html-split/run-split.sh --rendering-only
        RunSplitScript --> CoLocateAssets: Write styles.css, script.js & HTML to iframe-html/
    }

    Step4_HTMLSplit --> Step5a_Blueprint: Update plan-follower.md ledger

    state "Step 5a: Stage 1 Architecture Blueprint (PAUSE)" as Step5a_Blueprint {
        [*] --> InvokeClonerStage1: Parse inputs with gsheet-react-dashboard-cloner
        InvokeClonerStage1 --> DisplayBlueprint: Render Evidence Audit & Store Blueprints
        DisplayBlueprint --> AwaitGenerateCodebase: Prompt user for "GENERATE CODEBASE"
    }

    Step5a_Blueprint --> Step5b_Codebase: User replies "GENERATE CODEBASE"

    state "Step 5b: Stage 2 Modular Codebase Compilation" as Step5b_Codebase {
        [*] --> EmitCanonicalStructure: Generate multi-file React feature strictly matching reverse prompt tree
    }

    Step5b_Codebase --> Step6_BuildVerify: Update plan-follower.md ledger

    state "Step 6: Build Verification & Final Handoff" as Step6_BuildVerify {
        [*] --> ExecNpmBuild: Run npm run build in terminal
        ExecNpmBuild --> MarkAllCompleted: Mark all steps COMPLETED in plan-follower.md
        MarkAllCompleted --> HandoffSummary: Output absolute file paths to React component
    }

    Step6_BuildVerify --> [*]
```

---

## 📋 Step-by-Step Execution Summary

| Step | Action | Execution Type | Primary Output / Artifact |
| :---: | :--- | :---: | :--- |
| **1** | Init & Smart Config Setup | Automated | Sets defaults, creates `.wait` placeholders & `plan-follower.md` |
| **2** | Generate Reverse Prompt | Automated | Generates `sandbox/dashboards/<dashboard-name>/reverse-prompt-<feature-name>.md` |
| **3** | Batch Artifact Collection | User Action | Collects `specifications.md`, `data.csv`, and `iframe-html/iframe.html` (Reply **Confirm Artifacts Saved**) |
| **4** | Auto HTML Split | Automated | Splits DOM into `styles.css`, `script.js`, and cleaned HTML inside `iframe-html/` |
| **5a**| Stage 1 Blueprint | Automated | Generates Reconciliation Report & Architecture Blueprint |
| **5b**| Stage 2 Codebase Compilation | Interactive Trigger | Generates multi-file React feature inside `react-clone/` upon replying `"GENERATE CODEBASE"` |
| **6** | Build Verification & Handoff | Automated | Runs `npm run build`, marks ledger completed, and presents output paths |

